  _dialogueLines:
  - "So\u2026 the wandering shadow returns at last."
  - "Know you? I studied you. Your movements, your silence, your choices\u2026 even
    the mistakes you tried to bury."
  - I know. That is why I came.
  - A watcher. Nothing more. Nothing less. I observe what others fear to speak of.
  - "When the moon is red, follow the path behind the shrine. There\u2026 you will
    meet the first truth."
  - Ahh... You are still as strong as ever
